B.a_W=s(["Hizmeti yasalara ayk\u0131r\u0131 ama\xe7larla kullanmamak, verilere yetkisiz eri\u015fim sa\u011flamamak yasakt\u0131r.","M\xfc\u015fteri ve \xe7al\u0131\u015fan ki\u015fisel verilerinin yasal mevzuatta \xf6ng\xf6r\xfcld\xfc\u011f\xfc \u015fekilde i\u015flenmesinden taraf\u0131n\u0131z sorumludur."],t.s)
